1 ipv4.dns 8.8.8.8 &amp;&amp; nmcli connection up &quot;有线连接 1&quot;`\n\n## 2. 连接指定连接\n\n```bash\nnmcli connection up &quot;&lt;连接名或UUID&gt;&quot;\n```\n\n## 3. 连接 Wi-Fi（带密码）\n\n```bash\nnmcli device wifi connect &quot;&lt;SSID&gt;&quot; password &quot;&lt;密码&gt;&quot;\n```\n\n开放网络（无密码）：\n```bash\nnmcli device wifi connect &quot;&lt;SSID&gt;&quot;\n```\n\n## 4. 打开/关闭 Wi-Fi\n\n```bash\n# 开启\nnmcli radio wifi on\n\n# 关闭\nnmcli radio wifi off\n\n# 查看状态\nnmcli radio wifi\n```\n\n## 5. 打开/关闭有线网络\n\n找到有线设备名（通常为 `enp*` 或 `eth*`）：\n```bash\nnmcli -t -f DEVICE,TYPE device status | awk -F: &apos;$2==&quot;ethernet&quot; {print $1}&apos;\n```\n\n```bash\n# 开启\nnmcli device set &lt;设备名&gt; managed yes &amp;&amp; nmcli device connect &lt;设备名&gt;\n\n# 关闭\nnmcli device disconnect &lt;设备名&gt; &amp;&amp; nmcli device set &lt;设备名&gt; managed no\n```\n\n## 6. 断开指定连接\n\n按连接名断开：\n```bash\nnmcli connection down &quot;&lt;连接名&gt;&quot;\n```\n\n按设备名断开：\n```bash\nnmcli device disconnect &lt;设备名&gt;\n```\n</instruction>\n    </instructions>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>shortcut-navigations</name>\n    <description>快捷键相关测试</description>\n    <location>/home/ky/.kylinbot/workspace/skills/shortcut-navigations/SKILL.md</location>\n    <instructions>\n      <instruction>\n# 快捷键 (ShortcutNavigations) 对话测试\n\n## 测试流程\n\n### 音量键\n&gt; 增大音量 / 减小音量 / 静音\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/ShortcutNavigations \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.ShortcutNavigations.VolumeUp\n\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/ShortcutNavigations \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.ShortcutNavigations.VolumeDown\n\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/ShortcutNavigations \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.ShortcutNavigations.MuteToggleState\n\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/ShortcutNavigations \\\n  --meth