ion --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.GetAllScreenBrightness\n```\n\n### 2. 查主屏亮度\n&gt; 主屏亮度多少\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.GetPrimaryScreenBrightness\n```\n\n### 3. 调亮度\n&gt; 亮度调到60\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetPrimaryScreenBrightness 60\n```\n\n### 4. 调某个显示器亮度\n&gt; 把HDMI-A-1调到80\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetScreenBrightness &quot;HDMI-A-1&quot; 80\n```\n\n### 5. 统一所有显示器亮度\n&gt; 两个显示器都调到100\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetAllScreenSameBrightness 100\n```\n\n### 6. 查显示模式\n&gt; 当前什么显示模式\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.GetScreenMode\n```\n\n### 7. 切显示模式\n&gt; 切换到扩展模式\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetScreenMode &quot;extension&quot;\n```\n\n可选模式: &quot;primaryScreenOnlyMode&quot; (仅主屏), &quot;mirrorScreenMode&quot; (镜像), &quot;extensionMode&quot; (扩展), &quot;secondaryScreenOnlyMode&quot; (仅第二屏)\n\n### 8. 护眼模式\n&gt; 开启护眼模式\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetEyeCareEnabled true\n```\n\n### 9. 查护眼状态\n&gt; 护眼模式开着吗\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.IsEyeCareEnabled\n```\n\n### 10. 夜间模式\n&gt; 开启夜间模式\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetNightModeEnable true\n```\n\n### 11. 关夜间模式\n&gt; 关闭夜间模式\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetNightModeEnable false\n```\n\n### 12. 设置缩放\n&gt; 缩放率调到125%\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetScreenScale 1.25\n```\n\n### 13. 查缩放\n&gt; 当前缩放率多少\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.GetScreenScale\n```\n\n### 14. 自动亮度\n&gt; 开启自动亮度\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.SetAutoBrightBrightnessEnable true\n```\n\n### 15. 快捷键（仅笔记本）\n&gt; 增亮\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.IncreaseBuiltinScreenBrightness\n```\n\n&gt; 减亮\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Screen \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Screen.DecreaseBuiltinBrightness\n```\n\n---\n\n## 完整对话样例\n\n**你**: 查下当前显示器情况\n**誩**: 两台显示器：HDMI-A-1 亮度40，DP-2 亮度100，当前是扩展模式\n\n**你**: 两台都调到80，开护眼\n**誩**: ✅ 已全部设为80，护眼模式已开启\n\n**你**: 切到镜像模式\n**誩**: ✅ 已切换到镜像模式\n\n**你**: 关护眼，调到125%缩放\n**誩**: ✅ 护眼已关，缩放率已设为125%\n</instruction>\n    </instructions>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>power</name>\n    <description>电源管理相关操作</description>\n    <location>/home/ky/.kylinbot/workspace/skills/power/SKILL.md</location>\n    <instructions>\n      <instruction>\n# 电源管理 (Power) 对话测试\n\n## 测试流程\n\n### 1. 查电量\n&gt; 还有多少电\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.BatteryPercentage\n```\n\n### 2. 充电状态\n&gt; 在充电吗\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetBatteryState\n```\n返回值: 0=未知, 1=充电, 2=放电, 3=空, 4=充满, 5=准备充, 6=准备断\n\n### 3. 可用时长\n&gt; 还能用多久\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.TimeToEmpty\n```\n\n### 4. 充满时间\n&gt; 还有多久充满\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.TimeToFull\n```\n\n### 5. 电源模式\n&gt; 当前什么电源模式\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetPowerMode\n```\n返回值: 0=性能, 1=平衡, 2=节能\n\n### 6. 切到性能模式\n&gt; 切到性能模式\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.SetPowerMode 0\n```\n\n### 7. 切到节能模式\n&gt; 省电模式\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.SetPowerMode 2\n```\n\n### 8. 电源按键动作\n&gt; 按电源键会怎样\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetPowerButtonAction\n```\n\n### 9. 设置电源键动作\n&gt; 按电源键改成休眠\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.SetPowerButtonAction &quot;hibernate&quot;\n```\n可选值: &quot;interactive&quot;(询问), &quot;blank&quot;(息屏), &quot;suspend&quot;(睡眠), &quot;hibernate&quot;(休眠), &quot;shutdown&quot;(关机)\n\n### 10. 合盖动作\n&gt; 合盖会怎样\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetLidCloseAction\n```\n\n### 11. 设置合盖\n&gt; 合盖改成睡眠\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.SetLidCloseAction &quot;suspend&quot;\n```\n可选值: &quot;nothing&quot;(无操作), &quot;blank&quot;(息屏), &quot;suspend&quot;(睡眠), &quot;hibernate&quot;(休眠), &quot;shutdown&quot;(关机)\n\n### 12. AC息屏时间\n&gt; 插着电源多久息屏\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetScreenTimeoutOnAC\n```\n\n### 13. 设置AC息屏时间\n&gt; 插电时10分钟息屏\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.SetScreenTimeoutOnAC 600\n```\n（单位秒: 600=10分钟, 300=5分钟, 1200=20分钟）\n\n### 14. 电池息屏时间\n&gt; 用电池多久息屏\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetScreenTimeoutOnDC\n```\n\n### 15. AC睡眠时间\n&gt; 插着电多久睡眠\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetSleepComputerTimeOnAC\n```\n\n### 16. 低电量策略\n&gt; 低电量时会怎样\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetLowBatteryAction\n```\n\n### 17. 低电量阈值\n&gt; 低于多少算低电量\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetLowBatteryActionThreshold\n```\n\n### 18. 低电量通知阈值\n&gt; 多少电量时提醒\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetLowBatteryNotifyThreshold\n```\n\n### 19. 显示剩余时间\n&gt; 显示电池剩余时间吗\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.IsShowLeftTime\n```\n\n### 20. 有电池/有盖子\n&gt; 有没有电池 / 有没有盖子\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.IsBatteryPresent\n\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.IsLid\n```\n\n### 21. AC/DC电源策略\n&gt; 插电时电源策略\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetACPowerPolicy\n\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org/ukui/Framework/Devices/Power \\\n  --method org.ukui.Framework.Devices.Power.GetDCPowerPolicy\n```\n返回值: 0=性能, 1=平衡, 2=节能\n\n---\n\n## 完整对话样例\n\n**你**: 电源状态\n**誩**: 电量 75%，放电中，可用约 3小时20分，当前平衡模式\n\n**你**: 切到性能模式\n**誩**: ✅ 已切换到性能模式\n\n**你**: 合盖改成睡眠\n**誩**: ✅ 合盖动作已设为睡眠\n\n**你**: 插电时5分钟息屏，15分钟睡眠\n**誩**: ✅ 已设置：AC息屏300秒，AC睡眠900秒\n\n**你**: 电量低于10%时自动休眠\n**誩**: ✅ 已设置：低电量动作 &quot;hibernate&quot;，阈值 10%\n</instruction>\n    </instructions>\n  </skill>\n  <skill>\n    <name>touchpad</name>\n    <description>触控板相关操作</description>\n    <location>/home/ky/.kylinbot/workspace/skills/touchpad/SKILL.md</location>\n    <instructions>\n      <instruction>\n# 触摸板 (Touchpad) 对话测试\n\n## 测试流程\n\n### 1. 查开关\n&gt; 触摸板开着吗\n\n```\ngdbus call --session --dest org.ukui.Framework \\\n  --object-path /org